IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CHECK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N0 USAGE POINTER.
01 N1 USAGE POINTER.
01 N1-V PIC X(6) VALUE "caf" & X"C3" & X"A9" & X"00".
01 N2 USAGE POINTER.
01 N2-V PIC X(7) VALUE X"E4" & X"B8" & X"AD" & X"E6" & X"96" & X"87" & X"00".
01 N3 USAGE POINTER.
01 N3-V PIC X(5) VALUE X"F0" & X"9F" & X"98" & X"80" & X"00".
01 N-STATUS PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 MY-DATA USAGE POINTER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N0.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N1-V RETURNING N1.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N1 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N2-V RETURNING N2.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N2 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N3-V RETURNING N3.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N3 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    SET MY-DATA TO N0.
    STOP RUN.
